# 🎙️ Creative R&D Playground

An active sandbox for enterprise AI insights, creative experiments, and technical deep-dives.

## 📖 Overview

Technology moves on a compounding acceleration curve. I stay ahead of it by actively testing,
sometimes breaking, and creating with emerging tools. This is a living record of those
explorations, bridging high-level strategy and hands-on execution.

The through-line across everything here is the same: generative tools doing the parts they're good
at, a human doing the parts that carry the work.

---

## 🧪 Active Sandboxes

### 📝 [JennAI.blog](https://jennai.blog)

My primary hub for technical writing and recording observations.

- **Focus:** Enterprise AI insights, generative architecture, and hands-on tutorials.
- **Purpose:** Bridging high-level engineering strategy and practical application.

---

### 🔊 Synthetic Voice Engineering

Merging a decade in professional voiceover with modern generative tech.

- **Tools:** ElevenLabs API integration.
- **Milestone:** A high-fidelity voice clone with over 164.2k likes in real-world use.
  [Listen here](https://elevenlabs.io/app/voice-lab/share/6b5293afac57fd085dac3f58c7e8a68be63d0d3dafa32d5ec28c2290e5bd4f20/kddBBBVfGtKWVjCos6yL).
- **Application:** Automated narration, personalized GTM collateral, and dynamic voice-driven
  interfaces.

---

### 🎵 AI-Augmented Music Production

A working study in hybrid audio production

- **Tools:** Suno for generative composition; Audacity, REAPER, and iZotope Ozone for editing,
  mixing, and mastering.
- **Workflow:** Generate and select instrumental beds in Suno, my own lyrics and vocals. Any required audio engineering by hand.
- **Goal:** A seamless join between human performance and algorithmic synthesis.

#### 💿 Damsel

A full pop album, and the clearest example of collaborative AI work in this repo. (https://open.spotify.com/album/4ZoSm0jZnZJfHVCNsvDXJp?si=TVf-CULATcu_a9vyTSNorA&utm_source=copy-link)

The album exists because the generative tooling collapsed the cost of getting to a
usable instrumental tracks which is a gap in my abilities I was able to use technology to bridge.
An accompanying AI-generated music video was submitted to the LifeArt festival.

---

### 🎬 [Out of Office: The Musical](./out-of-office)

An out-of-office notice produced as a full musical short instead of a two-line auto-reply. My
lyrics, my vocals, a Suno instrumental, and animation assembled with AI tools.

Demonstration of the hybrid workflow described above, and the one where
the human contribution is apparent in the lyrics. 

[Watch it](https://youtu.be/wE2SKlTsxnY) · [Credits and lyrics](./out-of-office)

